# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [Open-source resources](/guides/) for details on contributing code to Qiskit. Information there includes the [code of conduct](/guides/code-of-conduct), PDF license agreements for [individual](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) and [corporate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf) contributors, [version strategy](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy), and the [contributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) guides.\n"
msgstr "Consultă [resursele Open-source](/guides/) pentru detalii despre contribuirea cu cod la Qiskit. Informațiile de acolo includ [codul de conduită](/guides/code-of-conduct), acordurile de licență PDF pentru contribuitori [individuali](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) și [corporativi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-cla.pdf), [strategia de versiuni](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy) și ghidurile pentru [contribuitori](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) și [mentenanți](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md).\n"

